  "body": "RENOVATION UPDATE\r\n\r\nCurrently under renovation - viewings are temporarily unavailable. We look forward to showing you the new look!\r\n\r\nInterested? Leave your details and we'll be in touch when viewings reopen.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of highly sought-after Mairangi Bay, this solid 1970s brick and tile home offers the perfect combination of space, flexibility, and family-friendly living.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 898sqm (more or less) freehold site with approximately 250sqm of floor area, this substantial home provides room for growing families to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features four bedrooms, a family bathroom, a spacious lounge, and open-plan living, dining and kitchen areas that form the heart of the home. The living spaces are filled with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout the day.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers exceptional flexibility, with a generous rumpus room, second bathroom, laundry, and internal access double garage - ideal for teenagers, guests, hobbies or working from home.\r\n\r\nOutside, the swimming pool and large backyard create the perfect setting for summer entertaining and family fun. The spacious grounds provide plenty of room for children and pets to play, along with ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the outstanding location, with Mairangi Bay Beach, local cafes, shops, parks, and everyday amenities all within easy reach. The property is zoned for the ever-popular Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and Westlake Girls' High School, offering access to some of the North Shore's most sought-after schooling options.\r\n\r\nLarge freehold family homes of this scale in Mairangi Bay are always in strong demand, with many tightly held by long-term owners. This is an opportunity to secure space, lifestyle, and exceptional schooling in one of the North Shore's most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nFor further information and to download the property documents, please visit:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/9WTF",
